@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="bevo-card">
    <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="bevo-headline-page text-bevo-orange">
            🌮 Privacy Policy
            <span class="bevo-underline bevo-underline-page bevo-underline-orange"></span>
        </h1>
    </div>

    <p>At Bevo's Tacos, we take your privacy as seriously as we take our salsa. Here's how we handle your information:</p>

    <h4 class="text-bevo-maroon">What We Collect</h4>
    <p>When you place a walkup or catering order with us, we collect only what we need to get your food to you: your name (for walkup orders) or your customer code (for catering orders), along with your order details like the number of tacos and burgers you'd like.</p>

    <h4 class="text-bevo-maroon">How We Use It</h4>
    <p>We use your order information to calculate your total, process your order, and make sure your delivery fee and sales tax are calculated correctly. We do not sell, rent, or share your information with third parties.</p>

    <h4 class="text-bevo-maroon">Data Retention</h4>
    <p>Order information is used only to complete your current transaction and is not stored beyond what's needed to serve your order.</p>

    <h4 class="text-bevo-maroon">Questions?</h4>
    <p>If you have any questions about how we handle your information, feel free to stop by the truck and ask us directly!</p>
</div>
